[38;2;124;124;124mThe problem: Given polynomials $f_1, \ldots, f_m \in \mathbb{Z}[x_1, \ldots, [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mx_n]$ with no common zero in $\mathbb{C}^n$, can we always find $g_1, \ldots, [0m
