[38;2;124;124;124m\in I$, meaning there exist $g_1, \ldots, g_m \in \mathbb{Q}[x_1, \ldots, x_n]$ [0m[38;2;124;124;124mwith $1 = \sum f_i g_i$.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mSo the answer is YES.[0m

